2026-10-09T01:04:04.5858421Z   ok   a 2 h fold-night outage reads its true age, not the wall clock's
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5858638Z   ok   and crosses the 90-minute stale floor a 2 h outage must cross
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5858816Z   ok   weather staleness across the fold is the true 2 h
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5859031Z   ok   spring gap: the plan age is the true 2 h, not 3 h of wall clock
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5859199Z   ok   spring gap: weather staleness is the true 2 h
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5859390Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night's ages were always true
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5859622Z   ok   a backward clock step publishes 0 h staleness, not a negative age
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5859796Z   ok   the plan age stays clamped at 0 after the same step
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5860021Z   ok   a fold-night handover 2 h old is refused against a 60-min window
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5860250Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain-night 2 h handover is refused identically
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5860455Z   ok   legionella hours_since reads true elapsed across the fold
