2026-10-09T01:04:04.5860847Z   ok   and that agreement is the OFF the true index commands
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5861204Z   ok   the fold-night outage stamped its last-good at the pre-fold instant
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5861422Z   ok   a mode unreadable for a TRUE 3 h 20 min is expired, not held good
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5861656Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night expires the same-age mode identically
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5861858Z   ok   a defrost running the fold's true 2 h books 7200 s of duty
2026-10-09T01:04:04.5862040Z   ok   NULL CONTROL: the plain night books the same 7200 s
