2026-10-09T01:04:04.6120644Z   ok   a copy in ANOTHER module is one copy, whatever its locals are called (#1738 a)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6120859Z   ok   a third copy costs one more, not two more: copies, not pairs
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6121110Z   ok   a re-wrap or a comment moves nothing: the window is the AST, not the lines
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6121336Z   ok   the node floor holds: two short shared statements are not a copy
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6121551Z   ok   the shipped window is 2 statements of at least 30 nodes (#1738)
