2026-10-09T01:04:04.6130473Z   ok   sum_cc is rejected IN THE CODE, with the reason and the issue it would break (#374)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6130734Z   ok   the dead-member census exempts the names HA looks up on an instance (#1395)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.6131031Z   ok   a @property nothing reads is a dead member; one a live member reads is not (D7-s3-02)
