2026-10-09T01:04:04.7951804Z   ok   an overlay beginning exactly now governs only the NEXT interval (no tag on the closing one)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7952015Z   ok   an overlay that began mid-interval tags the closing interval
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7952421Z   ok   a plan whose total draw sits exactly at the apportionment floor books the whole metered draw to space (share 1.0)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7952640Z   ok   the global boost mode freezes learning through the same reason
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7953162Z   ok   re-selecting boost while already in it starts no second tail (the tail is owed to LEAVING boost, not to being in it)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7953443Z   ok   leaving boost mode starts the settling tail (same mechanism, same owed tail)
2026-10-09T01:04:04.7953718Z   ok   leaving a non-boost mode starts no tail (comfort->auto never freezes learning)
